# LiveUSB shell scripts, chroot hooks and udev rules are copied verbatim into a
# Debian live-build chroot, where a CRLF ending breaks /bin/sh (": not found"),
# udev rule parsing and hook execution. Pin LF so a Windows checkout cannot
# reintroduce them; tests/test_liveusb_iso_pipeline.py asserts the same.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.hook.chroot text eol=lf
*.hook.binary text eol=lf
*.rules text eol=lf
